    <div class="wrap"><div class="wake-row rv">
      <div class="poster l"><img class="coverart" src="/assets/wake-v3/img/heart-wakes.jpg" alt="The Heart Wakes album cover: tattooed hands tearing open a shirt to show a cracked, glowing red heart" width="1000" height="1000"></div>
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="mono"><b>Wake the Heart</b> · 13 weeks · Nov 9 to Feb 1</p>
        <h2 class="bigtitle"><span class="chrome">The heart</span> <span class="red beatword">wakes.</span></h2>
        <p class="wake-line">A heart does not change the world by beating alone. <b>It changes the world by reaching another.</b></p>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn" type="button" data-play="the-heart-wakes">▶ Title song</button><a class="btn ghost" href="/wake-the-heart/">The 13 weeks</a></div>
