  <section class="wall2 seat lit" data-seed="47" id="thread"><span id="join-the-signal"></span><canvas class="paint" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="wrap"><div class="seat-grid">
      <div class="stack rv">
        <h2 class="seat-h"><span class="throw">Take a seat.</span><br><span class="tag">You’re welcome here.</span></h2>
        <p class="mono"><b>The Silver Thread</b> · add yours</p>
        <form class="field js-thread" id="join" style="width:100%" action="https://myghostheart.us22.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=a7ab330423f3b936c48b8d8ba&amp;id=880e8056a6&amp;f_id=00bec2e1f0" method="post"><label for="join-email" class="sr">Email address</label><input id="join-email" name="EMAIL" type="email" inputmode="email" maxlength="254" placeholder="Your email" autocomplete="email" required><div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-5000px"><input type="text" name="b_a7ab330423f3b936c48b8d8ba_880e8056a6" tabindex="-1" value="" autocomplete="off"></div><button class="btn" type="submit">Pull up a seat</button></form>
        <p class="note" id="join-msg">Every person who takes a seat adds a silver thread to the heart. Email only. New songs, new work from the studio, and every Sunday at the fire. Leave anytime.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="seat-side rv"><div class="heartbox2"><canvas id="living" role="img" aria-label="A cracked red heart bound in silver, with a silver thread running in from each person who joins"></canvas></div><div class="triad"><div class="r"><b>Red</b>is the feeling.</div><div class="k"><b>Black</b>is the unknown.</div><div class="s"><b>Silver</b>is the connection.</div></div></div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ================= VAULT ================= -->
<div class="view" id="v-vault" hidden><span id="vault"></span>
  <section><div class="wrap"><div class="stack">
    <div class="row"><p class="mono">GhostHeart / <b>The Vault</b></p><span class="stamp">Audio only</span></div>
    <h2 class="bigtitle" style="font-size:clamp(2.8rem,7.5vw,5.6rem)"><span class="chrome">The Vault</span></h2>
    <span class="tag" data-drip style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.8vw,2.3rem)">every song, as each week opens.</span>
    <div class="search" style="width:100%;margin-top:6px">
      <label for="vq" class="mono">Find a song or album</label>
      <input id="vq" type="search" placeholder="Search the Vault" autocomplete="off">
      <span class="scrawl" style="margin-top:10px">or tell me how your heart is ↓</span>
      <div class="chips" id="moods"></div>
      <p class="note" id="vcount" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <div id="albums" style="width:100%"></div>
  </div></div></section>
</div>

<!-- ================= STORY ================= -->
<div class="view" id="v-story" hidden><span id="story"></span>
  <div class="banner" id="banner">
    <div class="banner-frame">
      <img src="/assets/protector/banner.jpg" alt="Protected by GhostHeart: the hooded, faceless GhostHeart holds a torn red-and-black cloak over a row of people, among them a veteran with the flag, a trans person in the trans flag, a man in prison orange, a father carrying his family, a man in a suit, a man carrying everything he owns, and a worker with a wrench." width="1672" height="941">
      <span class="hbs" aria-hidden="true"><span class="hb" style="left:50.2%;top:20.5%;width:17%;animation-delay:0s"></span><span class="hb" style="left:50.8%;top:43.5%;width:5%;animation-delay:0.12s"></span><span class="hb" style="left:38.3%;top:42.5%;width:5%;animation-delay:0.2s"></span><span class="hb" style="left:64.3%;top:43%;width:5%;animation-delay:0.2s"></span><span class="hb" style="left:28.1%;top:43.5%;width:5%;animation-delay:0.3s"></span><span class="hb" style="left:75.5%;top:45.7%;width:5%;animation-delay:0.3s"></span><span class="hb" style="left:17.3%;top:43%;width:5%;animation-delay:0.4s"></span><span class="hb" style="left:85.9%;top:42.5%;width:5%;animation-delay:0.4s"></span></span>
      <span class="shine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <i class="cn c1" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="cn c2" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="cn c3" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="cn c4" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <span class="stamp s safe">you’re safe here</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section><div class="wrap"><div class="stack">
    <p class="mono"><b>About</b> GhostHeart Studios</p>
    <h2 class="bigtitle" style="font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.6rem)"><span class="chrome">Built from</span> <span class="tag" data-drip>the heart.</span></h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I’m the founder and creator of GhostHeart Studios, an independent creative business powered by technology and built from the heart. I turn my ideas, experiences, and imagination into music, visual stories, and digital projects that give people something to connect with.</p>
      <p>Everything starts with something personal: a feeling, a story, or something I need to say. Technology gives me the tools to bring it to life. Through social media, I share what I create, hear other people’s stories, and build a community that helps inspire what comes next.</p>
      <p>At the center of that world is GhostHeart, the dark, faceless protector I created. I’m the person behind the vision—the heart he protects. GhostHeart Studios is where I bring that vision into the world, creating work that speaks honestly, invites connection, and gives a voice to things that can be hard to put into words.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hazard" style="width:100%;margin-block:14px" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="mono"><b>Enter my world</b> · the life behind the name</p>
    <h2 class="bigtitle" style="font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.6rem)"><span class="chrome">Behind</span><br><span class="tag" data-drip>the scars</span></h2>
    <div class="row" style="gap:18px;margin-block:10px"><span class="stamp">Not one wound</span><span class="stamp s" style="transform:rotate(3deg)">Not one label</span><span class="stamp" style="transform:rotate(-2deg)">Still here</span></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I kept seeing people treated like they were nothing.</p>
      <p>People without a home being picked on. People struggling with addiction being laughed at. LGBTQ people getting torn apart for existing. Mental illness turned into a joke. Everybody pointing a finger while somebody else stood there taking the damage.</p>
      <p>And I had plenty to say about it. <span class="hit">But I wasn’t doing shit about it.</span></p>
      <p>That was hard to admit, because I really did care. I cared enough to get angry. Enough to hurt over it. But stepping forward meant giving people a reason to look at me.</p>
      <p class="pull"><span class="chrome">A way to hide and</span> <span class="red">still tell my story.</span></p>
      <p>GhostHeart carries the bravery, the strength, the courage I’m still trying to find in myself. He gives me a way to step forward while part of me still wants to stay hidden.</p>
      <p>I’m the man behind him. The one who cares deeply and is still scared.</p>
      <p>Maybe my story could help somebody. Even with the ugly parts. Even with the mistakes I have to own. Even if the world judged me for telling it.</p>
      <p class="pull"><span class="chrome">If I help one person, then I did</span> <span class="tag" data-drip style="font-size:1.1em">something.</span></p>
      <p class="note">Read the whole story: <a href="/GhostHeart_Story.html" style="color:var(--hot)">Behind the Scars</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="row"><button class="btn" type="button" data-play="the-heart-wakes">▶ Play The Heart Wakes</button><a class="btn ghost" href="#vault">Stay with a song</a></div>
    <span class="scrawl">no one has to disclose their own pain to belong here.</span>
  </div></div></section>
</div>

<!-- ================= LIVE ================= -->
<div class="view" id="v-live" hidden><span id="live"></span>
  <section class="firebg"><div class="wrap"><div class="stack">
    <div class="row"><p class="mono"><b>Sundays</b> · 10 AM Central · TikTok</p></div>
    <h2 class="bigtitle" style="font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.6rem)"><span class="chrome">Come to</span><br><span class="tag fire" data-drip>the fire.</span></h2>
    <p class="lede">Bring a thought, a question, a lesson, or something you’re ready to let go of. Come to listen or join in.</p>
    <ol class="steps" style="width:100%">
      <li><span class="n">1</span><h3>Bring it</h3><p>Drop a thought, a question, or a lesson in the comments. A topic is enough. You never have to share more than you want to.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">2</span><h3>We talk</h3><p>I pick a few, and we talk them through, one at a time.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">3</span><h3>Let it go</h3><p>If it’s something you’re done carrying, we throw it into the fire together. It’s a symbol, and it’s yours.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="pit" style="width:100%">
      <div class="air"><span class="said" id="said" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
      <span class="scrawl" style="position:relative">try it. what are you ready to let go of?</span>
      <div class="field" id="fire" role="group" aria-label="Throw something into the fire"><label for="fire-in" class="sr">Something to let go of</label><input id="fire-in" type="text" maxlength="60" placeholder="Type it here" autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="done"><button class="btn" type="button" id="fire-go">Throw it in</button></div>
      <p class="note" style="position:relative">Nothing you type is saved or sent anywhere. It burns and it’s gone.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="note" style="max-width:70ch">The next live date shows here only once it’s confirmed. This is a creative community conversation, not professional care. If you need more than a song can give, <a href="/GhostHeart_Resources.html">Find Support</a> is here.</p>
    <div class="row"><a class="btn ghost" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@ghosthearted1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on TikTok ↗</a></div>
  </div></div></section>
</div>

